# hash	a row may start with a hash
**Expected**	unknown
:---	:---
blanked	unknown
empty-reason	unknown
escaped\	bug
extra-fields	the reason
no-closing-pipe	the reason
no-reason	unknown
override	a later row replaces the reason
plain	the second field is the name, the fourth the reason
tabbed	tabs around a field are trimmed too
test name	only the exact header is skipped
